OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CSunday:FFor many Sunday promises to be 
OL,6,Fa much drier and brighter day than     
OL,7,FSaturday with sunny spells . However,  
OL,8,Fone or two showers may feed across in  
OL,9,Fthe southwesterly breeze.              
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,12,Fand Tuesday look mild, cloudy and      
OL,13,Fwindy with the chance of some rain.    
OL,14,FThe rain should clear to leave a       
OL,15,Fsunnier, less windy day on Wednesday.  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
